# Bard's planar map (ikeda.ode): its orbit, the zero-change curves and the
# stable manifold of a saddle, computed without the inverse map
# (XPPAUT 8.4, 25 Nov 2026). Saved as ikeda-manifold.png.
msg "A planar map: the orbit first"
keys i g                     # Initialconds -> Go
keys n n                     # Nullcline -> New: x=f(x,y) and y=g(x,y)
msg "Zero-change curves: they cross at the fixed points"
pause "Enter: the stable manifold of the saddle near (1.08, -2.41), drawn over them"
keys s m                     # Sing pts -> Fixed point here ...
click 1.08 -2.41             # ... near this point
ans n                        # Print eigenvalues? no
ans y                        # Draw invariant sets? yes: the stable manifold
msg "The stable manifold of the saddle (1.083, -2.408)"
shot ikeda-manifold.png
